# Keep the build context small and host-independent. Anything the image needs is
# built INSIDE the stages (web-builder runs its own `pnpm install`; py-builder
# runs `uv sync`), so host build outputs must never leak in — a host node_modules
# copied over the container's clean install would clobber it with the wrong
# platform's binaries and break `pnpm build`.

# Dependency + build outputs (rebuilt in-image)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
.venv
**/dist
# The embedded SPA is rebuilt fresh from web-builder and copied in; never ship a
# stale host copy (it is git-ignored too).
apps/server/src/spotdl_server/webui

# VCS + local tooling
.git
.github
.gitignore

# Python / test caches
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Local runtime data + docs/site (not needed to build the image)
data
site
.superpowers*
